at was kept, removed, and why.", "second": "9-20"}, {"beat": "payoff", "edit": "Reveal the clean decision and the three-step filter.", "second": "21-34"}, {"beat": "save and comment CTA", "edit": "Hold the checklist and ask one precise comment question.", "second": "last 3"}], "production_notes": {"props": ["phone", "tripod", "decision card", "three category-relevant options"], "safety": "No medical claim, no financial claim, no legal advice, and no guaranteed outcome claims unless properly substantiated.", "location": "Home, studio corner, hotel room, car, shop, venue, or desk setup depending on category.", "wardrobe": "Clean outfit that matches the category mood."}, "category_layer_pack": {"applied_layers": ["brand_lift_layer", "creator_style_adapter", "scene_energy_curve_layer", "risk_reputation_layer", "platform_conversion_layer", "audience_identity_layer", "luxury_signal_layer", "proof_without_boring_layer", "sponsor_softness_layer", "ritual_series_layer", "status_shift_layer", "comment_trigger_layer", "save_worthy_utility_layer", "relatability_break_layer", "viral_tension_layer", "cultural_localization_layer", "narrative_serial_layer", "absurd_procedure_layer", "comedy_worldbuilding_layer"], "category_fit_note": "This Luxury card uses a broad premium layer pack so the idea can adapt to the category while staying safe and practical.", "practical_effects": {"brand_lift_layer": "Clarifies what this idea adds to the creator''s taste, authority, and long-term perception.", "status_shift_layer": "Creates a before-to-after perception shift without unsafe transformation claims.", "luxury_signal_layer": "Adds restrained visual language, clean framing, and premium pacing.", "ritual_series_layer": "Makes the idea repeatable as a creator-owned format or recurring series.", "viral_tension_layer": "Creates a low-risk tension between expectation and reveal.", "comment_trigger_layer": "Adds a precise audience question that invites specific replies.", "creator_style_adapter": 