ic post.", "micro_behavior_guide": {"eye_contact": "Look into the lens for the hook and CTA; look down during proof and sorting.", "smile_timing": "Small smile after the reveal, not during the claim boundary.", "camera_attention": "Return to camera when explaining the boundary.", "product_handling": "Hold objects low and steady so the decision feels natural.", "facial_expression": "Soft confidence with a small recognition moment after the proof detail.", "avoid_over_advertising": "Do not repeat brand names, wave labels, or use urgent buying language."}, "one_sentence_premise": "This Luxury content idea uses a phone notes screen as the hook, a mistake correction as the trust signal, and a context boundary as the save trigger. The creative lane is a local atlas built around a caption shelf.", "creator_presence_mode": {"mode": "Style Strategist", "avoid": "Avoid copying a celebrity voice, overpromising outcomes, or turning the post into a hard sell.", "delivery_style": "Editorial, useful, selective, and visually precise.", "why_it_fits_creator": "This creator mode fits because The audience learns a style rule they can actually use."}, "hook_performance_pack": {"comedy_hook": "My decision process briefly became a tiny board meeting.", "luxury_hook": "The premium choice is the one you can explain calmly.", "hook_options": ["The part that looks effortless is actually one small mistake correction.", "Before you copy the final result, look at this local atlas filter.", "This is the Luxury decision filter I would save first.", "The premium version is not louder; it is more selective about popular but not always right.", "Which option would you remove from this setup?"], "relatable_hook": "I used to make this harder than it needed to be.", "first_line_hook": "The part that looks effortless is actually one small mistake correction.", "comment_trigger_hook": "What would you remove from this decision?", "first_second_visual_hook": "A polished final shot cuts to the small decision that made it work. The frame starts with a caption shelf in the phone notes screen."}, "personalization_slots": {"product_name": "{product_name}", "audience_pain": "{audience_pain}", "daily_context": "{daily_context}", "signature_phrase": "{signature_phrase}"}, "premium_decision_note": "This card is built as a complete premium execution system: hook, proof, scene plan, visual direction, caption logic, safety boundaries, and platform variants."}'::jsonb
